// Potential Persistence Via Shim Database In Uncommon Location | T1546.011 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/registry/registry_set/registry_set_persistence_shim_database_uncommon_location.yml
(registry.path:*\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows\ NT\\CurrentVersion\\AppCompatFlags\\InstalledSDB\\* AND registry.path:*\\DatabasePath*) AND (NOT winlog.event_data.Details:*\:\\Windows\\AppPatch\\Custom*)
